## Summary

Update `docket init` to create an orphan state branch (docket-state) for bug storage.

## Implementation

In `src/commands/init.rs`:

```rust
pub fn init() -> Result<()> {
    // ... existing jj init logic ...

    // Create orphan state branch from root
    Command::new("jj")
        .args(["new", "root()", "--no-edit"])
        .status()?;

    // Create .docket directory structure
    Command::new("jj")
        .args(["file", "write", ".docket/bugs/.gitkeep", "--content", ""])
        .status()?;

    // Describe and set bookmark
    Command::new("jj")
        .args(["describe", "-m", "docket: initialize state branch"])
        .status()?;
    Command::new("jj")
        .args(["bookmark", "set", "docket-state"])
        .status()?;

    // Return to trunk
    Command::new("jj")
        .args(["edit", "trunk"])
        .status()?;

    Ok(())
}
```

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] docket-state bookmark created as orphan branch
- [ ] .docket/bugs/ directory exists on state branch
- [ ] User returned to trunk after init
- [ ] Existing init behavior preserved
- [ ] Integration test
